.TH "nvme_init_set_features_voltage_threshold" 9 "nvme_init_set_features_voltage_threshold" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_set_features_voltage_threshold \- Initialize passthru command for Voltage Threshold
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_set_features_voltage_threshold
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool sv "  ","
.BI "__u8 vsens "  ","
.BI "bool evt "  ","
.BI "__u16 ovt "  ","
.BI "__u16 uvt "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sv" 12
Save value across power states
.IP "vsens" 12
Voltage Sensor Select (VSENS)
.IP "evt" 12
Enable Voltage Threshold (EVT)
.IP "ovt" 12
Overvoltage Threshold (OVT)
.IP "uvt" 12
Undervoltage Threshold (UVT)
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Set Features command with
FID value NVME_FEAT_FID_VOLTAGE_THRESHOLD
